  <h1 id="GameFramework_Services_LoadService" data-uid="GameFramework.Services.LoadService" class="text-break">Class LoadService
  </h1>
  <div class="markdown level0 summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Services.LoadService.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="4">Service that orchestrates all game loading operations
Handles loading workflow: validation -&gt; file loading -&gt; session creation -&gt; state transition
Integrates with TimeService for proper playtime handling</p>
</div>
